headroom-winnow
Copyright 2026 headroom-winnow contributors

This product is a plugin for Headroom (https://github.com/headroomlabs-ai/headroom),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It implements Headroom's
``headroom.compressor`` contract and follows its coding conventions and tool
configuration.

This product uses the Squeez approach and models by KRLabs
(https://github.com/KRLabsOrg/squeez), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, including the model KRLabsOrg/verbatim-rag-modern-bert-v2 and the
dataset KRLabsOrg/tool-output-extraction-swebench.

The pooled model distributed in this project's releases is fine-tuned from
jhu-clsp/ettin-encoder-32m (https://huggingface.co/jhu-clsp/ettin-encoder-32m),
licensed under the MIT License, on the dataset above using Squeez's training
code.
